{
  "description": "Draw one compound as a 2D structure — the default for a single substance.\n\nWrites print-ready PNG/SVG to the output folder and returns a panel with\nthe drawing, properties and functional groups. No ChemDraw needed.\n\nUse this tool when the request names structural formulas, molecular\nstructures or chemical drawings — \"draw aspirin\", \"structure of caffeine\".\nA bare compound name with no further request (\"caffeine\", \"aspirin\")\nalso means this tool: show the substance, and the panel carries its data.\n\nNot this tool for: several products of one reaction with yields (use\ngenerate_scope_table); several unrelated structures at once (use\nbatch_generate); differences between structures (use compare_molecules);\nan equation with an arrow (use generate_reaction); a named single value\nsuch as melting point, CAS number or GHS hazards (use lookup).\n\nIMPORTANT: Always pass English or IUPAC compound names, never localized\nnames — 'Aspirin' not 'Acetylsalicylsäure', 'Caffeine' not 'Coffein'.\nSMILES are always safe; use `label` for the localized display name.\n\nArgs:\n    name_or_smiles: English/IUPAC compound name or SMILES string.\n    label: Display name shown below the structure (may be localized).\n    formats: Any of \"png\", \"svg\", \"cdxml\" (default: png + svg). Add\n        \"cdxml\" only when the structure is to be edited in ChemDraw.\n    annotate_stereo: True prints CIP descriptors (R/S, E/Z) at each\n        stereocenter.\n    abbreviate_groups: True draws common substituents as the short labels\n        chemists write by hand (Ph, Bn, OAc, OMe, CO2H, NO2, tBu, Boc, Ts,\n        TMS). The chemistry is unchanged; hover tooltips in the panel are\n        switched off for abbreviated drawings.\n    render_style: \"\" standard · \"compact\" thin bonds for small print ·\n        \"presentation\" thick bonds for slides · \"grayscale\" b/w palette.\n",
  "inputSchema": {
    "properties": {
      "abbreviate_groups": {
        "default": false,
        "title": "Abbreviate Groups",
        "type": "boolean"
      },
      "annotate_stereo": {
        "default": false,
        "title": "Annotate Stereo",
        "type": "boolean"
      },
      "formats": {
        "anyOf": [
          {
            "items": {
              "type": "string"
            },
            "type": "array"
          },
          {
            "type": "null"
          }
        ],
        "default": null,
        "title": "Formats"
      },
      "label": {
        "default": "",
        "title": "Label",
        "type": "string"
      },
      "name_or_smiles": {
        "title": "Name Or Smiles",
        "type": "string"
      },
      "render_style": {
        "default": "",
        "title": "Render Style",
        "type": "string"
      }
    },
    "required": [
      "name_or_smiles"
    ],
    "title": "generate_moleculeArguments",
    "type": "object"
  },
  "name": "generate_molecule",
